# `data/` is the staging area: `stage_batch.sh` swaps one batch in at a time,
# and it is the directory the project's `locations` point at. Its contents are
# a copy of whichever batch is currently staged, so committing it would just
# duplicate `batches/` and create a misleading diff every time someone advances
# the demo.
#
# The directory itself is kept (via .gitkeep) because `depictio run` resolves
# the configured location before scanning, and a missing directory fails the
# project's DirectoryPath validation rather than scanning zero files.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
